      "start": -720,
      "details": "<p>E\u0161ahulezenzagmukam is translated\u00a0into Akkadian as\u00a0<em>b\u012bt h\u016bd libbi u r\u012b\u0161\u0101ti \u0161a isinni r\u0113\u0161 \u0161atti</em>.</p>",
      "review_state": "published",
      "description": "The Sumerian ceremonial name means \"House of Joy and Gladness for the Festival of the Beginning of the Year.\"",
